{"description":"\nAdd one or more items to the shopping cart.\n\nIf no cart exists, this tool makes a new cart. This tool adds products and gift\ncertificates.\n\nSteps\n\n1. Call the 'search_products' tool to find a product.\n2. Call the 'get_product_details' tool to get the variants and the modifier options.\n3. Call this tool to add the item.\n4. Call the 'create_checkout_url' tool to get a checkout URL.\n\nThe response returns the whole cart. Each item in 'cart.lineItems' has an 'entityId'.\nUse it as 'line_item_id' in the 'update_cart_item' tool.\nUse it as 'item_id' in the 'remove_item_from_cart' tool.\n\nRules\n\nSend 'quantity' and 'productEntityId' for each item.\nIf the configuration that the user chose has a variant, send 'variantEntityId'.\nSend 'variantEntityId' as null only for a configuration with no variant. See\n\"Configurations with no variant\" for when this is allowed.\n\nModifier options\n\nA modifier option is a product choice that is not a variant.\nExamples are an engraving message and a nicotine strength.\nThe 'get_product_details' tool returns these options in 'modifierOptions'.\n\nIf the product has no 'modifierOptions' and you send a variant, do not send\n'selectedOptions'.\nIf you send a variant in 'variantEntityId', do not send a variant option in\n'selectedOptions'. The variant sets those options.\n\nAn option is required if 'isRequired' is 'true'.\nSend each required option.\nIf you do not send a required option, the server does not add the item.\n\nTo send an option:\n1. Read the bucket name from 'selectedOptionsKey'.\n2. Add the option to 'item.selectedOptions' in that bucket.\n3. Send the 'optionEntityId' of the option.\n4. For a choice option, send 'optionValueEntityId'. Its number is the 'valueEntityId' of\n   the value that the user selected.\n\nSend only the buckets that you need.\n\nExample. A required choice option has a 'selectedOptionsKey' of \"multipleChoices\", an\n'optionEntityId' of 108, and a selected value with a 'valueEntityId' of 251:\n{\n      \"item\": {\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"productEntityId\": 88,\n        \"variantEntityId\": 67,\n        \"selectedOptions\": {\n          \"multipleChoices\": [ { \"optionEntityId\": 108, \"optionValueEntityId\": 251 } ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\nA free-entry bucket takes a typed value in place of an ID.\n'textFields' and 'multiLineTextFields' take \"text\".\n'numberFields' takes \"number\".\n'dateFields' takes \"date\".\nObey the 'constraints' of the option.\n\nIf a required option has more than one value, ask the user to select one value.\nDo not select a value yourself. Do not use the default value.\n\nIf 'unsupported' is 'true', you cannot send the option.\nIf such an option is also required, tell the user to buy the product on the website.\n\nConfigurations with no variant\n\nA variant option value can have no variant. The default value, such as \"None\", is often\none. The 'get_product_details' tool lists every value in 'variantOptions'. A value with\n'hasVariant' of 'false' is used by no variant that can be bought. It has no variant, or\nits variants are not on sale now, for example because they are out of stock.\n\nSend 'variantEntityId' as null only if all of these are true:\n- The user chose a value with 'hasVariant' of 'false'.\n- 'variants' is not empty. If it is empty, every value has 'hasVariant' of 'false', and\n  the product may not be on sale. Do not add the product. Tell the user.\n\nIf every value that the user chose has 'hasVariant' of 'true', and no variant in\n'variants' matches all of the values, that configuration does not exist. Do not add the\nbase product in its place. Tell the user that the configuration is not available.\n\nIf the store has no variant for the configuration, it adds the base product. If a variant\nexists but cannot be bought, the server rejects the item. Give that reason to the user.\n\nTo add it:\n1. Send 'variantEntityId' as null.\n2. Send every variant option of the product in 'item.selectedOptions.multipleChoices'.\n   Send the 'optionEntityId' of the option and the 'optionValueEntityId' of the value\n   that the user selected. Send the options that have a variant too, not only the value\n   that has none.\n3. Send each required modifier option as usual.\n\nExample. Variant option 81 has the value 899, which has no variant. Required modifier\noption 108 has the value 251:\n{\n      \"item\": {\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"productEntityId\": 88,\n        \"variantEntityId\": null,\n        \"selectedOptions\": {\n          \"multipleChoices\": [\n            { \"optionEntityId\": 81, \"optionValueEntityId\": 899 },\n            { \"optionEntityId\": 108, \"optionValueEntityId\": 251 }\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\nIf you leave out a variant option, the server rejects the item with the message \"This\nproduct has options, variant ID is required\". The message is misleading. A variant\noption that you did not send, or a value that does not belong to the option, causes it.\n","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"item":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"productEntityId":{"type":"integer"},"quantity":{"type":"integer"},"selectedOptions":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"checkboxes":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"optionEntityId":{"type":"integer"},"optionValueEntityId":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["optionEntityId","optionValueEntityId"],"type":"object"},"type":["null","array"]},"dateFields":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"date":{"type":"string"},"optionEntityId":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["optionEntityId","date"],"type":"object"},"type":["null","array"]},"multiLineTextFields":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"optionEntityId":{"type":"integer"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"required":["optionEntityId","text"],"type":"object"},"type":["null","array"]},"multipleChoices":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"optionEntityId":{"type":"integer"},"optionValueEntityId":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["optionEntityId","optionValueEntityId"],"type":"object"},"type":["null","array"]},"numberFields":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"number":{"type":"number"},"optionEntityId":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["optionEntityId","number"],"type":"object"},"type":["null","array"]},"textFields":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"optionEntityId":{"type":"integer"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"required":["optionEntityId","text"],"type":"object"},"type":["null","array"]}},"type":["null","object"]},"variantEntityId":{"type":["null","integer"]}},"required":["quantity","productEntityId","variantEntityId"],"type":"object"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"},"name":"add_item_to_cart","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cart":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"currencyCode":{"type":"string"},"formatted":{"type":["null","string"]},"value":{"type":"number"}},"required":["currencyCode","value","formatted"],"type":"object"},"amountInDisplayCurrency":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"currencyCode":{"type":"string"},"formatted":{"type":["null","string"]},"value":{"type":"number"}},"required":["currencyCode","value","formatted"],"type":"object"},"baseAmount":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"currencyCode":{"type":"string"},"formatted":{"type":["null","string"]},"value":{"type":"number"}},"required":["currencyCode","value","formatted"],"type":"object"},"baseAmountInDisplayCurrency":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"currencyCode":{"type":"string"},"formatted":{"type":["null","string"]},"value":{"type":"number"}},"required":["currencyCode","value","formatted"],"type":"object"},"createdAt":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"utc":{"type":"string"}},"required":["utc"],"type":"object"},"currencyCode":{"type":"string"},"discountedAm